        "cooked": "<p>Mists of <span class=\"bbcode-s\">OblivAeon</span> Oblivion reads \"1 Damage to each Invader in target land. &nbsp;1 Fear per building destroyed by this power to a maximum of 4\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If Bringer of Dreams and Nightmares uses this power, does it earn fear for \"destroying\" buildings beyond Dreamer's normal fear?</p>",
